{"task_id": "Mbpp/84", "solution": "# Memoization cache to store computed Newman-Conway numbers.\n# P(1)=1, P(2)=1 are the base cases.\n_newman_conway_cache = {1: 1, 2: 1}\n\ndef sequence(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the nth number in the Newman-Conway sequence using memoization.\"\"\"\n    if n in _newman_conway_cache:\n        return _newman_conway_cache[n]\n\n    # P(n) = P(P(n-1)) + P(n-P(n-1)) for n > 2.\n    # Recursively calculate P(n-1) first, then apply the formula.\n    pn_minus_1 = sequence(n - 1)\n    result = sequence(pn_minus_1) + sequence(n - pn_minus_1)\n    \n    _newman_conway_cache[n] = result\n    return result"}
