{"task_id": "Mbpp/99", "solution": "def decimal_to_binary(decimal_number: int) -> str:\n    \"\"\"\n    Converts a decimal integer to its binary string representation.\n    Returns '0' for input 0, otherwise computes binary using division and remainder.\n    \"\"\"\n    if decimal_number == 0:\n        return '0'\n\n    binary_string = []\n    temp_number = decimal_number\n\n    while temp_number > 0:\n        remainder = temp_number % 2\n        binary_string.append(str(remainder))\n        temp_number //= 2\n\n    return \"\".join(binary_string[::-1])"}
