{"task_id": "Mbpp/167", "solution": "import math\n\ndef next_power_of_2(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the smallest power of 2 greater than or equal to n.\n    Handles n=0 by returning 1 as per the assertion.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n == 0:\n        return 1\n    # Calculate the ceiling of log2(n) to find the exponent.\n    # Then compute 2 raised to that exponent.\n    exponent = math.ceil(math.log2(n))\n    return 2 ** int(exponent)"}
