{"task_id": "Mbpp/256", "solution": "import math\n\ndef count_Primes_nums(number: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Counts the number of prime numbers less than the given non-negative number.\"\"\"\n\n    def _is_prime(n: int) -> bool:\n        \"\"\"Determines if a given number is prime.\"\"\"\n        if n < 2:\n            return False\n        if n == 2:\n            return True\n        if n % 2 == 0:\n            return False\n        for i in range(3, int(math.sqrt(n)) + 1, 2):\n            if n % i == 0:\n                return False\n        return True\n\n    prime_count = 0\n    for num in range(2, number):\n        if _is_prime(num):\n            prime_count += 1\n            \n    return prime_count"}
