{"task_id": "Mbpp/274", "solution": "import math\n\ndef _validate_input(n: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Validates that the input n is a positive integer.\"\"\"\n    return isinstance(n, int) and n > 0\n\ndef _calculate_binomial_coefficient(n: int, k: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the binomial coefficient C(n, k).\"\"\"\n    return math.factorial(n) // (math.factorial(k) * math.factorial(n - k))\n\ndef even_binomial_Coeff_Sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of even index binomial coefficients for a given positive integer n.\n    This function sums C(n, k) for k = 0, 2, 4, ... up to n.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not _validate_input(n):\n        raise ValueError(\"Input must be a positive integer\")\n\n    total_sum = 0\n    # Iterate through even indices k from 0 up to n\n    for k in range(0, n + 1, 2):\n        total_sum += _calculate_binomial_coefficient(n, k)\n\n    return total_sum"}
