{"task_id": "Mbpp/290", "solution": "from typing import List, Tuple\n\ndef max_length(list_of_lists: List[List]) -> Tuple[int, List]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the list with the maximum length within a list of lists.\n    Returns a tuple containing the maximum length and the corresponding list.\n    \"\"\"\n    max_len = 0\n    max_list = []\n\n    for sublist in list_of_lists:\n        current_len = len(sublist)\n        if current_len > max_len:\n            max_len = current_len\n            max_list = sublist\n            \n    return (max_len, max_list)"}
