{"task_id": "Mbpp/294", "solution": "def _is_numeric(value):\n    \"\"\"Checks if a value is an integer or a float.\"\"\"\n    return isinstance(value, (int, float))\n\ndef _filter_numeric(input_list):\n    \"\"\"Extracts numeric elements from a list.\"\"\"\n    return [item for item in input_list if _is_numeric(item)]\n\ndef _find_maximum(numeric_list):\n    \"\"\"Calculates the maximum from a list of numeric values.\"\"\"\n    if not numeric_list:\n        # Returns None if no numeric values are found, as per design for graceful handling.\n        return None\n    return max(numeric_list)\n\ndef max_val(input_list):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the maximum numeric value in a given heterogeneous list.\n    Filters out non-numeric elements and processes only numeric values.\n    \"\"\"\n    numeric_values = _filter_numeric(input_list)\n    return _find_maximum(numeric_values)"}
