{"task_id": "Mbpp/398", "solution": "def sum_of_digits(numbers):\n    \"\"\"\n    Computes the sum of digits of each number in a given list.\n    Handles negative numbers by considering their absolute values.\n    \"\"\"\n\n    def _extract_digits(number):\n        \"\"\"Extracts individual digits from a single integer.\"\"\"\n        abs_number = abs(number)\n        return [int(d) for d in str(abs_number)]\n\n    def _calculate_digit_sum(digits):\n        \"\"\"Calculates the sum of a list of digits.\"\"\"\n        return sum(digits)\n\n    total_sum = 0\n    for num in numbers:\n        digits = _extract_digits(num)\n        total_sum += _calculate_digit_sum(digits)\n    return total_sum"}
