{"task_id": "Mbpp/555", "solution": "def difference(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculate the difference between the sum of cubes and the sum of natural numbers.\"\"\"\n    sum_of_natural_numbers = n * (n + 1) // 2\n    sum_of_cubes = sum_of_natural_numbers ** 2\n    return sum_of_cubes - sum_of_natural_numbers"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/555", "solution": "def difference(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the difference between the sum of cubes of the first n natural numbers\n    and the sum of the first n natural numbers.\n    \"\"\"\n    def _calculate_sum_of_numbers(num: int) -> int:\n        \"\"\"Calculates the sum of the first num natural numbers using a mathematical formula.\"\"\"\n        return num * (num + 1) // 2\n\n    def _calculate_sum_of_cubes(num: int) -> int:\n        \"\"\"Calculates the sum of cubes of the first num natural numbers using a mathematical formula.\"\"\"\n        sum_n = _calculate_sum_of_numbers(num)\n        return sum_n * sum_n\n\n    sum_cubes = _calculate_sum_of_cubes(n)\n    sum_numbers = _calculate_sum_of_numbers(n)\n    return sum_cubes - sum_numbers"}
