{"task_id": "Mbpp/612", "solution": "def merge(input_list: list[list]) -> list[list]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Transforms a list of two-element sublists into a list of two lists.\n    The first output list contains all first elements, and the second contains all second elements.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not input_list:\n        return [[], []]\n    \n    # Use zip to transpose the list of lists, then convert tuples to lists.\n    transposed_lists = [list(elements) for elements in zip(*input_list)]\n    return transposed_lists"}
