{"task_id": "Mbpp/626", "solution": "def triangle_area(radius: float) -> float | None:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the area of the largest triangle inscribed in a semicircle with a given radius.\n    Returns None if the radius is negative.\n    \"\"\"\n    def _validate_radius(r: float) -> bool:\n        \"\"\"Validates that the radius is a non-negative value.\"\"\"\n        return r >= 0\n\n    def _calculate_area(r: float) -> float:\n        \"\"\"Calculates the area using the formula radius squared.\"\"\"\n        return r * r\n\n    if not _validate_radius(radius):\n        return None\n    \n    return _calculate_area(radius)"}
