{"task_id": "Mbpp/630", "solution": "def get_coordinates(coord_tuple: tuple) -> list[list[int]]:\n    \"\"\"Extract all adjacent coordinates in a 3x3 grid pattern, centered on the input coordinate.\n\n    Coordinates are returned in row-major order (top-left to bottom-right).\n    \"\"\"\n    x_center, y_center = coord_tuple\n    result = []\n\n    # Iterate through x-offsets (-1, 0, 1) for rows\n    for dx in range(-1, 2):\n        current_x = x_center + dx\n        # Iterate through y-offsets (-1, 0, 1) for columns within each row\n        for dy in range(-1, 2):\n            current_y = y_center + dy\n            result.append([current_x, current_y])\n\n    return result"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/631", "solution": "def replace_spaces(input_string: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"\n    Replaces whitespaces with underscores and vice versa in the given string.\n    Processes the string character by character to perform the replacements.\n    \"\"\"\n    result_chars = []\n    for char in input_string:\n        if char == ' ':\n            result_chars.append('_')\n        elif char == '_':\n            result_chars.append(' ')\n        else:\n            result_chars.append(char)\n    return \"\".join(result_chars)"}
