{"task_id": "Mbpp/639", "solution": "def _filter_valid_names(names):\n    \"\"\"Filters a list of names, keeping only those starting with an uppercase letter.\"\"\"\n    return [name for name in names if name and name[0].isupper()]\n\ndef _calculate_length_sum(names):\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of lengths of strings in a list.\"\"\"\n    return sum(len(name) for name in names)\n\ndef sample_nam(names):\n    \"\"\"\n    Sums the length of names after removing those that start with a lowercase letter.\n    \"\"\"\n    filtered_names = _filter_valid_names(names)\n    total_length = _calculate_length_sum(filtered_names)\n    return total_length"}
