{"task_id": "Mbpp/786", "solution": "def right_insertion(array: list, target: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Locates the rightmost insertion point for a target value in a sorted array.\n    This function uses a binary search algorithm to achieve O(log n) time complexity.\n    \"\"\"\n    left, right = 0, len(array)\n\n    while left < right:\n        mid = left + (right - left) // 2\n        if array[mid] <= target:\n            left = mid + 1\n        else:\n            right = mid\n            \n    return left"}
