{"task_id": "Mbpp/786", "solution": "def right_insertion(arr: list[int], target: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the rightmost insertion point for a target value in a sorted array.\n    This uses a modified binary search to ensure O(log n) time complexity.\n    \"\"\"\n    left, right = 0, len(arr)\n\n    while left < right:\n        mid = left + (right - left) // 2\n        if arr[mid] <= target:\n            left = mid + 1\n        else:\n            right = mid\n    return left"}
